            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "I just followed the clues you left in that voice mail. You're great at riddles. We should probably add fight training to your coursework, though."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E16-C03-T04",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "Yeah."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E16-C03-T05",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Feel free to take notes."
