    {
      "id": "L-S1E16-C04",
      "title": "Hope and Landon fight the Headless Horseman.",
      "description": "Hope can't kill the Headless Horseman with magic, so she asks Landon for help and they defeat it together.",
      "participants": [
        {
          "character": "Hope",
          "version": "Hope"
        },
        {
          "character": "Landon",
          "version": "Landon"
        }
      ],
      "subjects": [],
      "scene_type": "conversation",
      "tags": [
        "fight",
        "teamwork",
        "banter"
      ],
      "importance": 2,
      "verified": false,
      "full": {
        "turns": [
          {
            "id": "L-S1E16-C04-T01",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Incendia!"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E16-C04-T02",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "action": "kicks monster"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E16-C04-T03",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "Yeah."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E16-C04-T04",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "He won't die. You know sci-fi stuff. Help me. How do I kill him?"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E16-C04-T05",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "Uh, Headless Horseman is more fantasy."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E16-C04-T06",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Get to the helpful part."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E16-C04-T07",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Ignari! Ah!"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E16-C04-T08",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "In the Tim Burton movie, they defeated him by giving him a bride. That wouldn't be my first choice."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E16-C04-T09",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Me, neither."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E16-C04-T10",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "In-in the O.G. cartoon, he had a pumpkin head. That... he might keep it with his horse? Correction! He's got it under his cape. Kill the head, the body dies. That's science faction."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E16-C04-T11",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Great. One head coming up."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E16-C04-T12",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "Oh, God, why is it moist?"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E16-C04-T13",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Uh, give me, give me."
          }
        ]
      },
      "short": {
        "turns": [
          {
            "id": "L-S1E16-C04-T08",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "In the Tim Burton movie, they defeated him by giving him a bride. That wouldn't be my first choice."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E16-C04-T09",
