    {
      "id": "L-S1E16-C06",
      "title": "Clarke frees Malivore and Landon kills Clarke.",
      "description": "Clarke interrupts them and frees Malivore. Landon kills Clarke and explains everything to Hope.",
      "participants": [
        {
          "character": "Hope",
          "version": "Hope"
        },
        {
          "character": "Landon",
          "version": "Landon"
        },
        {
          "character": "Clarke",
          "version": "Clarke"
        }
      ],
      "subjects": [],
      "scene_type": "conversation",
      "tags": [
        "phoenix"
      ],
      "importance": 3,
      "verified": false,
      "full": {
        "turns": [
          {
            "id": "L-S1E16-C06-T01",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Clarke",
              "version": "Clarke"
            },
            "text": "Nothing like young love, is there? Shame it has to be so short-lived."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E16-C06-T02",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Clarke",
              "version": "Clarke"
            },
            "text": "You'll find, baby brother, one of our family's worst traits is... well, we're terribly clumsy."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E16-C06-T03",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "No!"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E16-C06-T04",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Clarke",
              "version": "Clarke"
            },
            "text": "Aren't you gonna clap or something? That was a total power move."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E16-C06-T05",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Damn. Phoenix combat's no joke."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E16-C06-T06",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "Okay. We got to think. We got to figure something out to keep him from rising."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E16-C06-T07",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "What do you mean, \"him\"?"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E16-C06-T08",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "Ooh, we have a lot to catch up on."
          }
        ]
      },
      "short": {
        "turns": [
          {
            "id": "L-S1E16-C06-T05",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Damn. Phoenix combat's no joke."
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "L-S1E16-C07",
      "title": "Hope finds the loophole and asks Landon to kiss her.",
      "description": "With Malivore about to rise, Hope realizes she is the loophole. She asks Landon for a kiss and then kills him so he can't stop her.",
      "participants": [
        {
          "character": "Hope",
          "version": "Hope"
        },
        {
          "character": "Landon",
          "version": "Landon"
        }
      ],
      "subjects": [],
      "scene_type": "kiss",
      "tags": [
        "kiss",
        "sacrifice",
        "goodbye",
        "fate"
      ],
      "importance": 4,
      "verified": true,
      "full": {
        "turns": [
          {
            "id": "L-S1E16-C07-T01",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Wow. That's a lot to take in. So Malivore's your dad?"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E16-C07-T02",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "Weird, huh?"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E16-C07-T03",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "And he can't be killed, which is why Triad turned him to goo?"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E16-C07-T04",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "You're a quick study."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E16-C07-T05",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "But nothing's ever immortal. I mean, not really. Nature won't allow it. There's always a loophole."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E16-C07-T06",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "Any brilliant ideas? Because I think we're running out of time."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E16-C07-T07",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Just one. But you're gonna hate it."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E16-C07-T08",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Kiss me."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E16-C07-T09",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Handon",
              "version": "Handon"
            },
            "action": "kiss"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E16-C07-T10",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "I didn't hate that at all."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E16-C07-T11",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Not that. This."
          }
        ]
      },
