    {
      "id": "L-S1E16-C08",
      "title": "Hope says goodbye to Alaric before jumping into Malivore.",
      "description": "Hope calls Alaric to tell him where Landon is and that she is going to throw herself into Malivore, which will erase her from everyone's memory, including Landon's.",
      "participants": [
        {
          "character": "Hope",
          "version": "Hope"
        },
        {
          "character": "Alaric",
          "version": "Alaric"
        }
      ],
      "subjects": [],
      "scene_type": "conversation",
      "tags": [
        "sacrifice",
        "goodbye",
        "protect",
        "fate"
      ],
      "importance": 3,
      "verified": true,
      "full": {
        "turns": [
          {
            "id": "L-S1E16-C08-T01",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Alaric",
              "version": "Alaric"
            },
            "text": "Hope. Did you find Landon?"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E16-C08-T02",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Yeah."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E16-C08-T03",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Alaric",
              "version": "Alaric"
            },
            "text": "Okay, well, tell me where you are."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E16-C08-T04",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Fort Valley, Georgia. Landon's gonna need you when I'm done. You have to write it down."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E16-C08-T05",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Alaric",
              "version": "Alaric"
            },
            "text": "Wait. You're at Triad Headquarters?"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E16-C08-T06",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Yeah. Uh, don't worry, though. Everyone here is dead."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E16-C08-T07",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Alaric",
              "version": "Alaric"
            },
            "text": "Okay, listen, you're not making any sense. Just put Landon on the phone."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E16-C08-T08",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "I can't. Uh, he would have tried to stop me, so I had to kill him, too."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E16-C08-T09",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Alaric",
              "version": "Alaric"
            },
            "text": "What?"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E16-C08-T10",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "He'll come back. Don't worry. Even if I don't."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E16-C08-T11",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Alaric",
              "version": "Alaric"
            },
            "text": "Hope, tell me what the hell you're about to do right now before you do it."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E16-C08-T12",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Clarke won. He found the final artifact, and he tossed it into the pit, which is Landon's father, by the way. And now Malivore's gonna rise unless I stop him."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E16-C08-T13",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Alaric",
              "version": "Alaric"
            },
            "text": "Stop him how?"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E16-C08-T14",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Landon got all the answers, but, basically, Malivore was created by the blood of a werewolf, a witch and a vampire. It used to be that only they could destroy what they created, but nature found a loophole. By making me. The Tribrid. I'm the loophole."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E16-C08-T15",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Alaric",
              "version": "Alaric"
            },
            "text": "Hope, you listen to me. Now, this is a theory, okay, and you don't even know if this is gonna work, so you just sit tight, and you wait for me to get there."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E16-C08-T16",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "There's no time. I've always thought that I was a cosmic mistake, someone who should never have been born. But after all this time, I mean, my purpose is finally clear."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E16-C08-T17",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Think about it. I'm the answer to all of this. I can remember things about Malivore that no one else can. That Triad weapon didn't affect me. Did my blood heal Josie?"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E16-C08-T18",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Alaric",
              "version": "Alaric"
            },
            "text": "I am not okay with this."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E16-C08-T19",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "I know. But you will be, because once I toss myself into that pit, no one at school will remember me. Including you."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E16-C08-T20",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Alaric",
              "version": "Alaric"
            },
            "text": "Hope. You listen to me."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E16-C08-T21",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "I've spent years torturing myself, asking myself why my father sacrificed himself for me, to get to this point where, I mean, I totally understand it. And I don't want you to have to go through that pain, Dr. Saltzman. You've been through enough."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E16-C08-T22",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "And I don't want anyone at school to miss me, because they're my friends. Maybe I would have seen that sooner if I hadn't been beating myself up all this time."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E16-C08-T23",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "This is where you tell me that even though you wish you could change my mind, you know I'm doing the right thing. This is the part where you tell me you're proud of me."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E16-C08-T24",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Alaric",
              "version": "Alaric"
            },
            "text": "You know I'm proud of you. You know it. What is it you need me to do?"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E16-C08-T25",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Call maintenance. Have 'em pack up my room. Take my files, all those notes I know that you keep about me, and burn them. Along with Landon's journal."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E16-C08-T26",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Alaric",
              "version": "Alaric"
            },
            "text": "Listen, if you want to erase yourself, that is on you, okay, but you can't ask me to do it, too."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E16-C08-T27",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "I'm sorry, Dr. Saltzman. But I trust you more than I trust anyone. I wish I would have figured that out sooner, too."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E16-C08-T28",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "I got to go."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E16-C08-T29",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Alaric",
              "version": "Alaric"
            },
            "text": "Hope, listen to me. Wait."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E16-C08-T30",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Not an option. Uh-uh. Uh, promise me you're gonna do what I said. Promise me."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E16-C08-T31",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Alaric",
              "version": "Alaric"
            },
            "text": "All right. Fine. I promise."
          }
        ]
      },
