            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "I can't. Uh, he would have tried to stop me, so I had to kill him, too."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S1E16-C08-T10",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "He'll come back. Don't worry. Even if I don't."
          }
        ]
      }
